	<section_number>46.2-850</section_number>
	<catch_line>Change of course after giving signal</catch_line>
	<text>
		Drivers having once given a hand or light signal shall continue the course thus indicated, unless they alter the original signal.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-235; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-218; 1989, c. 727.</history>
</law>
